{
  "source": "video-audit/work-with-ai-opener-v14-2026-11-04/edited.wav",
  "duration": 131.3,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.22,
      "text": "You've met the tool and seen what it can do."
    },
    {
      "start": 2.82,
      "end": 3.7,
      "text": "Now it gets practical."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.62,
      "end": 6.52,
      "text": "How do you actually work with it?"
    },
    {
      "start": 7.38,
      "end": 9.8,
      "text": "Here's what most people miss when they first log in."
    },
    {
      "start": 10.52,
      "end": 11.8,
      "text": "Two people can sit down,"
    },
    {
      "start": 12.24,
      "end": 15.04,
      "text": "type a request into the exact same AI interface,"
    },
    {
      "start": 15.72,
      "end": 17.14,
      "text": "and get completely different results."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.12,
      "end": 19.22,
      "text": "One gets a generic paragraph,"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.98,
      "end": 22.02,
      "text": "the other a highly polished draft."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.96,
      "end": 24.08,
      "text": "Think of it like taking a photograph."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.02,
      "end": 28.7,
      "text": "Two people aim identical smartphones at the exact same sandwich."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.37,
      "end": 31.18,
      "text": "One person snaps a picture in a rush,"
    },
    {
      "start": 31.58,
      "end": 33.48,
      "text": "getting a blurry, poorly lit shot."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.4,
      "end": 36.48,
      "text": "The other carefully frames the subject,"
    },
    {
      "start": 37.04,
      "end": 39.06,
      "text": "adjusts the lighting and captures a crisp,"
    },
    {
      "start": 39.32,
      "end": 40.34,
      "text": "cover-worthy image."
    },
    {
      "start": 41.34,
      "end": 42.44,
      "text": "The camera hardware never changed."
    },
    {
      "start": 43.08,
      "end": 44.12,
      "text": "To get a sharp result,"
    },
    {
      "start": 44.7,
      "end": 46.46,
      "text": "you have to give the tool a clear goal,"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.94,
      "end": 49.1,
      "text": "and then critically verify the answer it gives you"
    },
    {
      "start": 49.1,
      "end": 50.02,
      "text": "before you use it."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.56,
      "end": 51.52,
      "text": "As this board points out,"
    },
    {
      "start": 51.88,
      "end": 54.22,
      "text": "the same tool yields vastly different results"
    },
    {
      "start": 54.22,
      "end": 55.14,
      "text": "depending on the user,"
    },
    {
      "start": 55.64,
      "end": 57.66,
      "text": "because AI does not replace your thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 57.66,
      "end": 59.08,
      "text": "It multiplies it."
    },
    {
      "start": 59.56,
      "end": 62.16,
      "text": "This roadmap shows what will explore in this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.72,
      "end": 65.72,
      "text": "We are going to look closely at how to work with AI,"
    },
    {
      "start": 66.48,
      "end": 68.3,
      "text": "and this syllabus breaks the process down"
    },
    {
      "start": 68.3,
      "end": 69.82,
      "text": "into three distinct steps."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.44,
      "end": 73.28,
      "text": "The first step is to find where AI helps."
    },
    {
      "start": 73.96,
      "end": 75.48,
      "text": "Before you type a single prompt,"
    },
    {
      "start": 75.86,
      "end": 77.76,
      "text": "you have to recognize which tasks"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.76,
      "end": 79.72,
      "text": "artificial intelligence handles well,"
    },
    {
      "start": 80.26,
      "end": 81.66,
      "text": "and which ones it struggles with."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.08,
      "end": 84.56,
      "text": "Once you diagnose the specific problem you have,"
    },
    {
      "start": 84.56,
      "end": 87.14,
      "text": "you can select the correct application to solve it."
    },
    {
      "start": 87.68,
      "end": 89.98,
      "text": "Next, we move to phase two of the syllabus."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.44,
      "end": 91.44,
      "text": "Ask better questions."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.26,
      "end": 94.02,
      "text": "This is where you formulate useful inquiries."
    },
    {
      "start": 94.9,
      "end": 97.34,
      "text": "You have to establish clear instructions for the software,"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.9,
      "end": 100.04,
      "text": "and understand the boundaries of what information"
    },
    {
      "start": 100.04,
      "end": 102.1,
      "text": "the model actually has access to"
    },
    {
      "start": 102.1,
      "end": 103.28,
      "text": "when it generates an answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.18,
      "end": 105.48,
      "text": "Giving AI the right details"
    },
    {
      "start": 105.48,
      "end": 107.2,
      "text": "helps it give you a better answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.1,
      "end": 109.98,
      "text": "Third, evaluate and improve."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.68,
      "end": 111.46,
      "text": "Check the answer,"
    },
    {
      "start": 112.06,
      "end": 112.92,
      "text": "improve it through conversation,"
    },
    {
      "start": 113.52,
      "end": 115.08,
      "text": "and choose when a different model,"
    },
    {
      "start": 115.34,
      "end": 117.12,
      "text": "more thinking, or research could help."
    },
    {
      "start": 117.74,
      "end": 119.78,
      "text": "The result depends on how you use the tool."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.24,
      "end": 121.9,
      "text": "Don't just use AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 122.82,
      "end": 123.76,
      "text": "Work with it."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.32,
      "end": 125.7,
      "text": "It doesn't replace your thinking."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.26,
      "end": 126.96,
      "text": "It multiplies it."
    }
  ],
